      "fTerm": "HANDLES FOR HAND IMPLEMENTS (attaching the blades or the like to handles of hand tools for soil working <b>A01B 1/22</b>; handles of hand implements for harvesting <b>A01D 1/14</b>; handles integral with brushware <b>A46B</b>)<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>This subclass <u>covers</u>:<ul type=\"\"disc\"\"><li>handles for hand implements, in general;</li><li>handles for hand implements for particular purposes, subject to Note (2) below.</li></ul></li><li>This subclass <u>does not cover</u> handles provided for elsewhere, e.g. it does not cover those provided for in <b>A45B 9/02</b>, <b>A45C 13/22</b>, <b>A45C 13/26</b>, <b>A47B 95/02</b>, <b>A47J 45/00</b>, <b>B23D 51/01</b>, <b>B25J 13/02</b>, <b>B26B</b>, <b>B60N 3/02</b>, <b>B62B 5/06</b>, <b>B62B 9/20</b>, <b>B62K 21/26</b>, <b>B62M 3/14</b>, <b>B65D 25/28</b>, <b>E05B</b>, <b>G05G</b>.</li></ul>",
