      "fTerm": "WINDOWS, WINDSCREENS, NON-FIXED ROOFS, DOORS, OR SIMILAR DEVICES FOR VEHICLES; REMOVABLE EXTERNAL PROTECTIVE COVERINGS SPECIALLY ADAPTED FOR VEHICLES (fastening, suspending, closing, or opening of such devices <b>E05</b>)<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>Windows, windscreens, non-fixed roofs, doors, or similar devices which are of general applicability, irrespective of whether described or claimed only for vehicles, are also classified in subclass <b>E06B</b>.</li><li>Attention is drawn to the Note following the title of class <b>B60</b>.</li></ul>",
