      "count": 0,
      "ipcCode": "",
      "fTerm": "CAPSTANS; WINCHES; TACKLES, e.g. PULLEY BLOCKS; HOISTS (winding or unwinding ropes or cables for feeding or storage purposes <b>B65H</b>; rope or cable-winding or unwinding mechanisms for lifts <b>B66B</b>; hoisting devices specially adapted for suspended scaffolds <b>E04G 3/32</b>)<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>This subclass <u>covers</u>:<ul type=\"\"disc\"\"><li>rope, cable, or chain winding or unwinding mechanisms for moving all loads except lift cages, e.g. winches for dredges;</li><li>braking or detent devices characterised by their application for retarding, or preventing, rotary movement of a winding drum or barrel.</li></ul></li></ul>",
