      "fTerm": "METHODS, EQUIPMENT, OR MACHINES FOR USE IN UPHOLSTERING; UPHOLSTERY NOT OTHERWISE PROVIDED FOR<br><br><b><u>Subclass indexes</u></b><br><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">LOOSE FILLING MATERIALS; TREATMENT THEREOF; RESILIENT PADS</td><td><b>1/00</b>; <b>3/00</b>; <b>5/00</b></td></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">MAKING UPHOLSTERY; FITTING SPRINGS THEREIN</td><td><b>7/00</b>; <b>9/00</b></td></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">FINISHED UPHOLSTERY; UPHOLSTERY PANELS</td><td><b>11/00</b>; <b>13/00</b></td></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">AUXILIARY DEVICES OR TOOLS</td><td><b>15/00</b></td></p></tr></table>",
