      "fTerm": "SUBJECT MATTER NOT OTHERWISE PROVIDED FOR IN THIS SECTION<b>[8]</b><br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>This subclass <u>covers</u> subject matter that:<b>[8]</b><ul type=\"\"a\"\"><li>is not provided for, but is most closely related to, the subject matter covered by the subclasses of this section, and</li><li>is not explicitly covered by any subclass of another section.</li></ul></li></ul>",
