    "B66F7/02A": {
      "code": "B66F7/02A",
      "level": 1,
      "parent": "B66F7/02\\",
      "ja": "支持フレーム，すなわち少なくとも支柱から成る支持部と，これに対し索体によつて昇降する載置部材とを有するもの〔注．原則として車輪等により横行するものは含まない。　載置部に代えて吊下部を持つもの→クレーン，Ｂ６６Ｃ，　載置部にスライディングフォークを有し横行するもの→スタッカクレーン，Ｂ６５Ｇ１／００，Ｂ６６Ｆ９／０７，　建造物の上部から索体により載置部が吊り下げられるもの→建設用足場，ゴンドラ，Ｅ０４Ｇ，　シャフト内を昇降し床間その人荷の運搬に供されるもの→エレベータ，Ｂ６６Ｂ　載置部に代え特定の物「図」",
      "en": "characterized by the installation of a supporting frame, that is, a supporting portion consisting of at least a supporting pole and mounted members that are ascended/descended by the tracting cable with respect to the abovementioned frame.  [Notes: In principle, supporting frames that are made horizontally slidable by using wheels, etc., are not included. When there exists the suspension portion in place of the mounting portion, B66C Crane, shall be assigned. When there exists a sliding fork that enables the horizontal movement at the mounting portion, B65G1/00, B66F9/07 Stacker crane, shall be assigned. When the mounting portion is suspended from the upper portion of a building by using the tracting cable, E04G Construction scaffold, Gondola, shall be assigned. When there exists the function to convey staff and cargo by ascending/descending the platform in the shaft, B66B Specific items in place of the mounting portion, shall be assigned.][figure]",
      "count": 104,
      "ipcCode": "B66F7/02",
      "fTerm": "3F330",
      "childFlag": 0,
      "sourceFile": "fi_B66F.txt",
      "kind": "fi"
    },
