      "code": "B66F9/08T",
      "level": 3,
      "parent": "B66F9/08R",
      "ja": "特にマストレール等またはローラの当接面の材料に特徴を持つもの〔例．焼入れ硬化面を持つレール，弾性表面を持つローラ〕「図」",
      "en": "Characterised particularly by the materials of the contact surfaces of the mast rails, the rollers or others, e.g., rails with hardened surfaces and rollers with elastic surfaces [FIG]",
      "count": 23,
      "ipcCode": "B66F9/08",
      "fTerm": "3F333",
      "childFlag": 2,
      "sourceFile": "fi_B66F.txt",
