      "level": 3,
      "parent": "B66F9/08\\",
      "ja": "フリーリフト〔注．マストの上昇を伴なわず、フォークを一定量上昇させるための構造。ただし専用シリンダを備えたいわゆるフルフリーマストについては９／０８Ｐ，Ｑ。特にシリンダや配管に特徴があるものは９／２２Ｄ，Ｅが優先〕「図」",
      "en": "Free lifts (note: structures for lifting forks by a certain height without raising the masts; for the so-called full free masts with an exclusive cylinder: 9/08P and Q; and for those that are characterised by cylinders and piping in particular, 9/22D and E take precedence) [FIG]",
