      "en": "Others [e.g. Blinking of alarm lamp for moving and seating switch] [Display, driving direction and communication] [Note: Operation management of forklifts, that is, the directions about cargo and shelves by using the computer chips, the registration of the finish of work and so on, shall be referred to G06F15/24 (Data processing system for inventory management.) The operation management of stacker cranes is classified to B65G1/.] [figure]",
